on</abbr></ref> Cnuts Gesetzbuch</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> Insc Ip Hunt; Danorum provincia <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hn">Hn</ref> 6,1; Danorum lex <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ECf">ECf</ref> 10,33; <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:irrig"><abbr>irrig</abbr></ref> <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:dafur"><abbr>dafür</abbr></ref>:</hi> lex Anglorum 30; leges Danorum <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ECfRetr">ECf retr</ref> 33 | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:franzosisch"><abbr>Fz</abbr></ref>:</hi> Denelahge <ref type="lawCode" target="law:LeisWl">Leis Wl</ref> 21,2; 4 (<hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:oder"><abbr>oder</abbr></ref></hi> -ahe?); -ahe 2,2; 3; 4. 3,3. 17,1. 21,4; Danelahe 2,3 <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:folgende"><abbr>f.</abbr></ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:LatVersion">L</ref>. 21,2 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:LatVersion">L</ref>; Denelae 2,3 <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:folgende"><abbr>f.</abbr></ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:I">I</ref>. 21,2 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:I">I</ref>. 39,2. 42,2; Danelae 2,2 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:I">I</ref>. [<hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:vergleiche"><abbr>Vgl</abbr></ref>.</hi> Norðengle.] — <hi rend="italic"><ref type="lawCode" target="law:InCn">In</ref></hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> <hi rend="italic">ist nur Ostanglien</hi> (<hi rend="italic">Guthrums Reich</hi>) <hi rend="italic">gemeint, wenn und insofern Teile <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:von"><abbr>von</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> <hi rend="italic">zurückgehen <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:auf"><abbr>auf</abbr></ref> Guthrums Lebenszeit; in heutiger, späterer Form <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:aber"><abbr>aber</abbr></ref> kann</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 7,2 <hi rend="italic">